sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Developer
    participant S as React SPA
    participant A as Express API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant W as Report worker
    U->>S: Generate PDF (publish when ready)
    S->>A: POST /reports/pdf
    A->>D: INSERT report, status PENDING
    A-->>S: 202 report, Location /reports/31
    loop every few seconds
        W->>D: SELECT next PENDING FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    end
    W->>D: read documentation within the requested scope
    W->>W: render PDF
    W->>D: INSERT report_file, UPDATE report READY, publish
    loop until READY or FAILED
        S->>A: GET /reports/31
        A-->>S: 200 status
    end
    S->>A: GET /reports/31/file
    A-->>S: 200 application/pdf
